msgstr "Kirimkan tip!"

#: main.lua:151
msgid ""
"<p>Various enhancements have been made to allow Tally to be used with a "
"screen reader. Keyboard shortcuts for closing counter windows have been "
"added.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Berbagai penyempurnaan telah dilakukan agar Tally dapat digunakan dengan "
"pembaca layar. Pintasan keyboard untuk menutup jendela penghitung juga telah "
"ditambahkan.</p>\n"

#: main.lua:156
msgid "Main Window"
msgstr "Jendela Utama"

#: main.lua:159 main.lua:176
msgid "Quit Application"
msgstr "Tutup Aplikasi"

#: main.lua:164 main.lua:199
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "Pintasan Keyboard"

#: main.lua:169 main.lua:200
msgid "About Tally"
msgstr "Tentang Tally"

#: main.lua:173
msgid "Counter Window"
msgstr "Jendela Penghitung"

#: main.lua:181
msgid "Close Window"
msgstr "Tutup Jendela"

#: main.lua:208
msgid "Create a new counter"
msgstr "Buat penghitung baru"

#: main.lua:212
msgid "Delete selected counters"
msgstr "Hapus penghitung yang dipilih"

#: main.lua:218
msgid "Filter counters by name and/or color"
msgstr "Saring penghitung berdasarkan nama dan/atau warna"

#: main.lua:223
msgid "Menu"
msgstr "Menu"

#: main.lua:227 main.lua:383
msgid "Select counters to delete"
msgstr "Pilih penghitung yang akan dihapus"

#: main.lua:240
msgid "Filter by name…"
msgstr "Saring dengan nama…"

#: main.lua:308
msgid "Add to list"
msgstr "Tambahkan ke list"

#: main.lua:310
msgid "Add this counter to the list"
msgstr "Tambahkan penghitung ini ke list"

#: main.lua:379
msgid "Stop selecting without deleting anything"
msgstr "Berhenti memilih tanpa menghapus apa pun"

#: main.c:134
#, c-format
msgid ""
"An unrecoverable error occurred when loading Tally, preventing the program "
"from starting.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terjadi kesalahan tak terpulihkan saat memuat Tally, sehingga program tidak "
"bisa dimulai.\n"
